msgid "Ryuuji「......Frankly, no idea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Francamente, ni idea.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. You were surprisingly stoic＿about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Fuiste sorprendentemente＿estoico al respecto.」"

